  "Id": 2449,
  "Title": "AKU-ISMC 2020-2021 Publications Catalogue Now Online",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "Details of new and upcoming publications",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "We are delighted to announce that our new publications catalogue is now "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "online",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "link",
                "attrs": {
                  "href": "/ismc/publications/Documents/AKU%20Publications%20Catalogue%202020-21%20v5.pdf",
                  "target": "_self",
                  "linktype": "url",
                  "uuid": null,
                  "anchor": null,
                  "custom": {}
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", containing details of all of our new, forthcoming and current publications. Upcoming publications in 2021 include "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Human Rights",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "italic"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Reformist Islam and Blasphemy and Apostasy in Islam: Debates on Shi'a Jurisprudence",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "italic"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", both by Mohsen Kadivar. The catalogue also contains information on the Institute's"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " Abdou Filali-Ansary Occasional Paper Series ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "italic"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "and forthcoming journal; "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Journal of Material Cultures in the Muslim World",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "italic"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". "
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The Institute's publications address current trends of thought about Islam, Muslims and Muslim societies. By creating access to scholarship from Muslim contexts in the English language and on a global platform, our publications foster intellectual exchange and dialogue about and between Muslim societies and cultures."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
